            <ArticleTitle>Suspected opioid overdose case resolved by CYP2D6 genotyping.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>121-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/FTD.0b013e31824a1e21</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 14-year-old female with suspected narcotic overdose had CYP2D6 genotyping performed to verify opiate intoxication. The role of pharmacogenetics in pain management and individualization of opiate pharmacotherapy is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
